      "description": "<p data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"908\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"908\">The 5th Dimension – (Last Night) I Didn't Get To Sleep At All / The Riverwitch</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1050\">Original 1972 Bell Records 45 RPM single featuring the hit <strong data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1016\">\"(Last Night) I Didn't Get To Sleep At All\"</strong> backed with <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1050\">\"The Riverwitch.\"</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1147\">An original vintage pressing from one of the most recognizable vocal groups of the early 1970s.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1152\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j02m21\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1172\">Record Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1394\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ezes2j\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1201\">\nArtist: The 5th Dimension\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2199u6\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1252\">\nTitle: (Last Night) I Didn't Get To Sleep At All\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubr9yc\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1277\">\nB-Side: The Riverwitch\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"x2u7n1\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1299\">\nLabel: Bell Records\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxmzf6\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1324\">\nCatalog Number: 45,195\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8imy\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1350\">\nFormat: 7\" Vinyl Single\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r3wzuj\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1366\">\nSpeed: 45 RPM\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lzryq8\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1379\">\nYear: 1972\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10vwi65\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1394\">\nCountry: USA\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1399\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17si63v\" data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1418\">Track Listing</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1430\"><strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1430\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1474\">\n<li data-section-id=\"tj4y5w\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1474\">\n(Last Night) I Didn't Get To Sleep At All\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1486\"><strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1486\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1503\">\n<li data-section-id=\"x55r9m\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1503\">\nThe Riverwitch\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1508\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"s1o1x1\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1528\">Condition Notes</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"2095\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1np7kt\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1644\">\nVinyl shows moderate to heavy cosmetic wear, including surface scratches and scuffs consistent with age and use.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ufz659\" data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1867\">\n<strong data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1707\">There is a small chip on the inner center rim/hole area.</strong> This is clearly shown in the listing photos. The damage does <strong data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1813\">not appear to reach the playable grooves</strong>, but it is being disclosed for complete transparency.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mer0p\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1920\">\nLabels remain clean and readable with normal wear.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q0d4fr\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2007\">\nRecord has been visually inspected only and has not been professionally play-tested.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wgmxjv\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2095\">\nPlease review all photos carefully, as they are of the exact record you will receive.</li></ul>",
